    {
      "heading": "The chase behind the leaders",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "person-yi-chia-chen-identity-0"
      ],
      "text": "Domdolus Tolus closes third on the ARC-AGI-2 public board at 82.08, behind Tufa Labs at 88.06 and Yi-Chia Chen @ Fields Model at 84.72. Both leaders are unchanged since the previous close. nvbanana drops one place to fourth despite holding 81.39, and rabbithole slips to fifth at an unchanged 80.83. The edition has no safe baseline comparison for Domdolus Tolus, so its third-place score is established but its daily gain is unknown."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Chilakala makes the top ten",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board"
      ],
      "text": "Ravi Teja Chilakala adds 4.73 points to reach 74.17 and ninth, four places above the previous close. That strengthens an existing provisional gold-band position rather than marking a first entry into it. Lashen Learning makes a separate push, gaining 5.97 to reach 66.53 and eighteenth. ARC Raiders remains sixteenth at 68.75, the unchanged provisional gold score, leaving Lashen Learning 2.22 points short of that score. Public medal bands are not final awards."
    },
    {
      "heading": "The pressure extends below gold",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board",
        "wire-2026-10-25-1557-arc-2-rxe-climbs-to-52nd"
      ],
      "text": "yuritosci rises thirteen places to twenty-fourth at 65.56, with a gain of 9.87. 復活の混テキスト reaches twenty-fifth at 65.42, and masspeaks advances to twenty-seventh at 63.75. The afternoon wire’s rxe report supplies another substantial climb: 17.50 points to 47.36 and fifty-second from 1,334th in its observed window. That remains a dated wire result, not an additional gain after publication."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Unchanged scores can still lose ground",
      "sourceIds": [
        "board"
      ],
      "text": "ARC Mutants holds 41.81 but drops two places to sixty-fifth. Mithil A Vakde remains at 33.89 and falls eleven places to 122nd. The silver score rises from 32.64 to 32.78 and bronze from 31.81 to 31.94, illustrating the pressure of a moving field even while the gold score holds steady. Social and discussion research was not refreshed for this edition; no older local-evaluation claim is treated as a fresh submitted result."
    }
